ndZaFZ6YWxEUUZsY3FNVWpFZ2haLVNmdFRhdGh0Sml4SHc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-01","zh":"人工智慧代理顛覆平台經濟？分析師測試 Muse 後拋棄 Airbnb"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1075531/000107553126000009/bkng-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our mission is to make it easier for everyone to experience the world. We aim to provide consumers with a best-in-class experience with tailored planning, payment, language, and other options seamlessly connecting them with our travel service provider partners. We offer these services through five primary consumer-facing brands: Booking.com, Priceline, Agoda, KAYAK, and OpenTable:","zh":"我們的使命是讓每個人都能更輕鬆地體驗世界。我們的目標是透過量身定制的計劃、支付、語言和其他選項，為消費者提供一流的體驗，將他們與我們的旅遊服務提供者合作夥伴無縫連接。我們透過五個主要面向消費者的品牌提供這些服務：Booking.com、Priceline、Agoda、KAYAK 和 OpenTable："},{"en":"We are proud of the meaningful progress we are making on our strategic initiatives as we continue to create more value for our consumers and partners, including:","zh":"我們為我們的策略性舉措取得的有意義的進展感到自豪，因為我們繼續為消費者和合作夥伴創造更多價值，包括："},{"en":"integrating new generative artificial intelligence (\"Gen AI\") features to enhance the consumer and partner experience and drive efficiencies in our operations;","zh":"整合新的生成人工智慧（「Gen AI」）功能，以增強消費者和合作夥伴的體驗並提高我們的營運效率；"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We are executing against our long-term strategy to create an ideal AI-powered traveler experience, offering our customers relevant options and suggestions at the times and in the language they want them, making trips booked with us seamless, easy, and valuable. We refer to this as the \"Connected Trip.\" The goal of our Connected Trip vision is to offer a differentiated and personalized travel planning, booking, payment, and in-trip experience for each trip, enhanced by a robust loyalty program that provides value to travelers and partners across all trips. In the near term, we are focused on providing consumers the ability to build a complete travel itinerary from AI-powered inspiration and planning to in-trip suggestions for attraction options. We continue to grow our Connected Trip verticals in 2025, including 37% year-over-year flight ticket growth, and about 80% attraction ticket grow","zh":"我們正在執行我們的長期策略，以創造理想的人工智慧驅動的旅行者體驗，以客戶想要的語言及時為客戶提供相關的選項和建議，使透過我們預訂的旅行變得無縫、輕鬆且有價值。我们将此称为“互联旅行”。我們互聯旅行願景的目標是為每次旅行提供差異化和個性化的旅行規劃、預訂、支付和旅行體驗，並透過強大的忠誠度計劃增強，為所有旅行中的旅行者和合作夥伴提供價值。短期內，我們的重點是為消費者提供建立完整旅行行程的能力，從人工智慧驅動的靈感和規劃到景點選擇的旅遊建議。到 2025 年，我們將繼續發展互聯旅行垂直領域，其中機票同比增長 37%，景點門票同比增長約 80%"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete globally with both online and traditional travel and restaurant reservation and related services. The markets for the services we offer are intensely competitive and constantly evolving. Competing offerings can be launched at a relatively low cost, with the pace of innovation increasing and the cost to do so decreasing as a result of Gen AI. Our current and potential competitors include the largest global technology companies, which have significantly more consumers, consumer data, and resources than we do, and may be able to leverage other aspects of their businesses to compete more effectively with us.","zh":"我們透過線上和傳統旅遊以及餐廳預訂及相關服務在全球範圍內競爭。我們提供的服務市場競爭激烈且不斷發展。競爭產品可以以相對較低的成本推出，隨著創新步伐的加快和 Gen AI 帶來的成本下降。我們目前和潛在的競爭對手包括全球最大的科技公司，它們比我們擁有更多的消費者、消費者數據和資源，並且可能能夠利用其業務的其他方面與我們更有效地競爭。"},{"en":"For more information regarding current and potential competitors and the competitive nature of the markets in which we operate, see Part I, Item 1A, Risk Factors - \"Intense competition could reduce our market share and harm our financial performance.\"","zh":"有關當前和潛在競爭對手以及我們經營所在市場的競爭性質的更多資訊，請參閱第一部分，第 1A 項，風險因素 - “激烈的競爭可能會減少我們的市場份額並損害我們的財務業績。”"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Merchant Revenue","val":17755000000,"zh":"商戶收入"},{"name":"Agency Revenue","val":7968000000,"zh":"代理收入"},{"name":"Advertisingandotherrevenues","val":1194000000,"zh":"廣告和其他收入"}],"total":26917000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":24338000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"NL","val":21700000000,"zh":"荷蘭"},{"name":"US","val":2579000000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":26917000000}},"peers":["EXPE","MAR","MELI","SPGI","INTU"]}}